      "chunk_text": "Kunal Mehta inquired about starting a new health plan after his old one expired and asked about reducing the standard 30-day waiting period. Ravi Menon explained that individual plans have a fixed 30-day waiting period unless covered by an employer group plan. Additionally, Kunal requested and received his claim-history summary and the latest health-plan brochure, and stated he would review them and follow up.",
